>
<main>
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container page-hero-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow"><h4>Cloud &amp; Infrastructure</h4></div><h1>Secure, scalable infrastructure built for today and ready for tomorrow.</h1><p>Servers, cloud platforms, virtualization, applications, networks, backups, and security all need to work together to keep your organization productive.</p></div><div class="hero-panel"><ul><li>Physical and virtual servers</li><li>Cloud and hybrid environments</li><li>Business application support</li><li>Backup and recovery strategy</li></ul></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container split"><aside class="sticky-note"><div class="kicker"><h4>Strong foundations</h4></div><h2>Infrastructure should create confidence, not uncertainty.</h2><p>We help design, manage, secure, and optimize technology foundations that support daily operations and future growth.</p></aside><div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Monitoring &amp; Proactive Management</h3><p>Monitor systems, servers, applications, storage, cloud resources, and network services so potential issues can be addressed early.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="6" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><rect height="6" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="14"></rect><path d="M7 7h.01M7 17h.01"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Physical &amp; Virtual Server Management</h3><p>Support for physical servers, virtual machines, hosted platforms, and core business workloads.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.5 19H8a5 5 0 1 1 1.1-9.9A6 6 0 0 1 20 12.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 17.5 19z"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Cloud &amp; Hybrid Infrastructure</h3><p>Design and management for cloud services, on-premises systems, and hybrid environments that align with operations and security needs.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="7" width="7" x="3" y="3"></rect><rect height="7" width="7" x="14" y="3"></rect><rect height="7" width="7" x="3" y="14"></rect><rect height="7" width="7" x="14" y="14"></rect></svg></span><div><h3>Business Application Support</h3><p>Installation, troubleshooting, maintenance, and support for the software platforms your team relies on.</p></div></div>
<div class="feature-row"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"></ellipse><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5"></path><path d="M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"></path></svg></span><div><h3>Backup &amp; Recovery Strategy</h3><p>Backup planning designed around your systems, data, risk tolerance, and recovery needs.</p></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="cta-band">
<div class="container">
<div class="kicker">
<h4>Build a more dependable foundation</h4>
</div>
<h2>
      Improve the reliability, security, and manageability of your infrastructure.
    </h2>
<p>
      Whether you are modernizing servers, moving workloads to the
      cloud, improving backup and recovery, supporting business
      applications, or managing a hybrid environment, Bleufoot can
      help you create a practical infrastructure plan.
    </p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-light" href="/quote-request?service=Cloud%20%26%20Infrastructure%20Management">
  Discuss Your Infrastructure →
</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact">
        Ask an Infrastructure Question
      </a>
</div>
</div>
